   "text": "University of Essex International College - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Essex International College - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nEssex is one of eight young universities which are part of the Young Universities for the Future of Europe alliance, a cross-border alliance of higher education institutions created to promote staff and student mobility. Essex is also a founding partner of the Young European Research Universities network. Essex was named University of the Year at the Times Higher Education Awards in 2018. The university has produced many notable alumni in several fields, including two Nobel laureates, a head of state, foreign ministers, MPs, scientists, artists, politicians, authors, and filmmakers.\nStudents have a number of foundation study options that will help them on your path to an Essex degree. While a Foundation Certificate or International Year One will enable students to enrol on an undergraduate degree, a Pre-Master’s course will do the same for a postgraduate degree.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/06/2026 10:42\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:46\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £25,330.00\nMin: £16,209.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n14%\n3,305 of 23,613 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1855\nCampus(es)\nColchester\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nBelarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, Syria, Ukraine, United States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n30/09/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lxwsSvq0zJk\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
